            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">Add Jira when you first set up Jarvis.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.4</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Jira is now one of the places you can pick when you first set up
      Jarvis, next to Mail and Slack.</li>
  <li>Settings → Jira has a Sync now button, so you no longer wait up to
      15 minutes for new issues to show up.</li>
  <li>A new “All my open issues” switch in Settings → Jira brings in every
      open issue assigned to you, not only the recent and active ones.</li>
  <li>Issues you finish in Jira now close in Focus even when you have a
      very large backlog.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
